// Lyris Voxel: items (see data/README.md). Read once at start-up; no recompile.
//
// Each entry either ADDS an item (a new key) or CHANGES a built-in one (an
// existing key: only the fields given change). Built-in keys: flint, stick,
// plant_fibre, flint_axe_head, flint_blade, flint_shovel_head, flint_pick_head,
// flint_axe, flint_knife, flint_shovel, flint_pickaxe, axe (the Woodcutter's
// Axe), and copper_/bronze_/iron_/steel_ axe, pickaxe, shovel (no iron_axe);
// Phase I (items_phase1.cpp): foods (blueberries, mushroom, flatbread ...),
// cordage, flint_spear(_point), flint_hoe(_blade), emmer_grain, wild_lentils,
// flour, pots, crucibles, moulds, bricks, charcoal, copper_/bronze_ *_head.
//
// Comments like these and a trailing comma are allowed.
